{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dream Ranch</strong> is the first of <strong>NANANO</strong>'s series. Cute and mystical stories awaits you!</h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140600/extras/22280350619ea78dbcc8212fa5e54048.poster.avif?t=1736923739\" width=610 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140600/extras/22280350619ea78dbcc8212fa5e54048.webm?t=1736923739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140600/extras/22280350619ea78dbcc8212fa5e54048.mp4?t=1736923739\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ranch life in a fantasy world!</h2>One day when you were beat down by corporate life, you happen to come across an advertisement. The advertisement was looking to hire a ranch hand. Sick of your corporate life, you set off to work at the ranch, dreaming of a leisurely life.<br><br><strong>NINANO: Dream Ranch</strong> is a game where you raise animals and converse with locals to develop the village.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140600/extras/1d9cb97b0983fb18bac7d07d540f95ad.avif?t=1736923739\" width=616 height=170 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Neighbors with colorful personalities</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> You'll be able to meet diverse locals such as Elves, Demons, Vampires, Anthropomorphs and many more.<br></li><li> Become a friend, a lover or a spouse.<br></li><li> Build up your relationship and you just might receive a special gift.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Raising Animals</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> You can evolve animals into various forms.<br></li><li> You'll be able to obtain different products depending on their evolution.<br></li><li> Care with love and you just might obtain a more precious product.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Village Beautification Project</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> You can build various facilities in the village.<br></li><li> You can invite new neighbors to the village. Just like how you moved to the village.<br></li><li> Let's spruce up the village to make the place more vibrant.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Food and Cooking</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> You'll have to eat some food when you become hungry.<br></li><li> If you don't, you might pass out from hunger.<br></li><li> There are many food and recipes to try out. Try collecting them all!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fishing</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> You can catch different fish depending on the time and place including other factors.<br></li><li> There are exotic fish that only exists in NINANO.<br></li><li> There are over 80 species to collect!<br></li><li> If you are interested, you can donate to the Aquarium to show them off.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Festivals</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Every year the village holds various festivals and contests.<br></li><li> Soda Festival, Fishing Contests, Horse Racing Contests and many more.<br></li><li> Experience the village in a whole new way!</li></ul><br>There are many other contents that await your attention. Come and enjoy your stay at the Ranch!","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ranch Rookie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2140600/bbd6691b61fbc60d71c9bf001de7418787290491.jpg"},{"name":"Moving Gifts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2140600/b991e04e4817927dc31ff7dbac0653bab65d89ff.jpg"},{"name":"Expert Ranch Owner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2140600/91182150af1deb584321eda94bcccf98ed58edca.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary Ranch Owner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2140600/b8cbe5373ba4881f932c6