br></li><li> Care with love and you just might obtain a more precious product.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Village Beautification Project</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> You can build various facilities in the village.<br></li><li> You can invite new neighbors to the village. Just like how you moved to the village.<br></li><li> Let's spruce up the village to make the place more vibrant.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Food and Cooking</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> You'll have to eat some food when you become hungry.<br></li><li> If you don't, you might pass out from hunger.<br></li><li> There are many food and recipes to try out. Try collecting them all!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fishing</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> You can catch different fish depending on the time and place including other factors.<br></li><li> There are exotic fish that only exists in NINANO.<br></li><li> There are over 80 species to collect!<br></li><li> If you are interested, you can donate to the Aquarium to show them off.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Festivals</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Every year the village holds various festivals and contests.<br></li><li> Soda Festival, Fishing Contests, Horse Racing Contests and many more.<br></li><li> Experience the village in a whole new way!</li></ul><br>There are many other contents that await your attention. Come and enjoy your stay at the Ranch!","developers":["NABI"],"dlc":[3227130,3227120],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2140600/header.jpg?t=1736923739","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 12.04 or newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2 GHz +<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000<br>